{"slug":"power-actress-alix-effie-morales-lapri-was-reportedly-arrested-in-dekalb-county-on-multiple-charges","postId":79959,"title":"Power Actress  Alix 'Effie Morales'  Lapri Was Reportedly Arrested In DeKalb County on Multiple Charges","htmlContent":"<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"328\"><a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/?s=Alix+Lapri\">Alix Lapri</a>, who is well-known for her portrayal of Effie Morales in Starz's Power and its sequel Power Book II: Ghost, was arrested in DeKalb County, Georgia last week.</p>\n<p data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"681\">   Lapri, who has a legal name of Alexus Lapri Geier, was arrested on Monday evening and charged with disorderly conduct and cruelty to children in the third degree. She had a reservation just before 5 p.m. and was incarcerated for just over 24 hours before being released.</p>\n<p data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"681\">Authorities reported that Lapri had been charged with third-degree cruelty to children and disorderly conduct.</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DNzZVwd2BiK/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DNzZVwd2BiK/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">A post shared by HOLLYWOOD UNLOCKED (@hollywoodunlocked)</a></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\n<h2 data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"681\">Rising Star in Acting and Music</h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm4821684/\">In 2011</a>, Lapri's career began with the signing of a contract with Crown World Entertainment. She gained early recognition through a series of song covers with fellow artist Jacob Latimore, including a rendition of Usher and Alicia Keys' classic 'My Boo.'\n\nIn 2012, her initial EP, I Am Alix Lapri, was released and received positive feedback from both fans and critics online. Her acting career quickly gained momentum due to her roles in multiple television shows and films. Her portrayal of Effie Morales in the Power series made her a household name after working with Gerard Butler and 50 Cent in the action thriller 'Den of Thieves'.\n<div></div>\n<div>A character known for her intelligence, resourcefulness, and complex relationship with the lead character of the show.</div>\n<h2>Impact of the Arrest</h2>\nShe posted a video of her partying at a bar on TikTok and Instagram on August 21, 2025. The caption stated, “drop that sh*t, DJ.” In a follow-up post, she was pictured in a shooting location for her ongoing acting venture, with several behind-the-scenes photos and clips.\n\n“gotta keep at it, buddy. Chase the dream and know no fear,” the caption read.\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DNyRBS_4rpM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DNyRBS_4rpM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">A post shared by Alix Lapri (@thealixlapri)</a></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\n\nHer Instagram Story, posted 15 hours ago, shows her wearing a party outfit and pouting at her selfie camera. The Story was accompanied by two laughing emojis and one kiss emoji.\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-548677\" src=\"https://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/9e3cea6f-d206-4cd5-ba48-213856813b2a-572x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"572\" height=\"1024\" />\n\n. For now, neither Lapri nor her representatives has issued a statement, leaving fans and industry observers waiting for further details. This story is in progress, and updates will come as more information becomes available.","excerpt":"Actress Alix Lapri, best known as Effie Morales from Power, was arrested in DeKalb County on charges of disorderly conduct and child cruelty.","publishedAt":"2025-08-26T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2025-08-26T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"50-cent","name":"50 Cent"},{"slug":"alix-lapri","name":"Alix Lapri"},{"slug":"ghost","name":"Ghost"},{"slug":"power","name":"Power"},{"slug":"power-book-ii-ghost","name":"Power Book II: Ghost"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"https://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/9e3cea6f-d206-4cd5-ba48-213856813b2a-572x1024.jpeg"},"inlineImageUrls":["https://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/9e3cea6f-d206-4cd5-ba48-213856813b2a-572x1024.jpeg"],"readingTimeMin":2,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/power-actress-alix-effie-morales-lapri-was-reportedly-arrested-in-dekalb-county-on-multiple-charges/"}